  "description": "*\"If you can't do it, just eat it.\"\n\n\"...You can do it. Just do it.\"* \n\nAt twenty, the first adult night of their lives. To celebrate becoming adults, Jeong-Wook, Seung-Woo, and Woo-Hyuk rent a pension and spend the night drinking. Seung-Woo and Woo-Hyuk exchange meaningful glances and suggest a drinking game, and Jeong-Wook casually agrees. However, the moment the first video plays—the man in Yeong-Sang is masturbating through his asshole.\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
